Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Activate
? Bot2.Mana = {G}
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Azorius Chancery.Activate
! Bot1.Modes(1; 2)
Bot1.Modes({U})
? Bot1.Mana = {W}{U}{U}

